WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Your Mac. On your time.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Stay with the lecture.
Brightness stays yours.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Leave the work running.
Builds. Downloads. Long tasks.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Follow Lid connects both.
Open for focus. Closed for work.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Set your time.
30 minutes. A few hours. Until you stop.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Safety stays awake.
You stay in control. Always starts Off.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Native. Local. Free and open source.
lidpilot.app
